     <p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-align:center;line-height:170%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高三综合素质</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">终</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">评等级、获奖情况、自评报告统计通知</span></span></strong></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">通知一：综合素质</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 170%;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">终评</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等级</span></span></strong></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高三各班主任：</span></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-bottom: 0;line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">根据省教育厅和市教育局文件，要求做好高三学生综合素养</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">终评</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等级，等级评价依据学生综合素质情况及班主任或相关责任人考评。评价结果分三等，用</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">B</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">C</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">表示，分别代表</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“优秀”“好”“尚需努力”。</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">品德表现和创新实践</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">A</span><span style="font-family:宋体">等比例名额如下，</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">C</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等比例不超过</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">5%</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></strong></p><table width="460"><tbody><tr style="height:17px" class="firstRow"><td width="141" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">班级</span></span></strong></p></td><td width="73" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A等人数</span></span></strong></p></td><td width="166" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-width: 1px; border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="v