dding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高中三年级</span>(14)<span style="font-family:宋体">班</span></span></p></td><td width="81" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 13px">12</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:17px"><td width="141" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高中三年级</span>(07)<span style="font-family:宋体">班</span></span></p></td><td width="73" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 13px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 13px"><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span></span></p></td><td width="166" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高中三年级</span>(15)<span style="font-family:宋体">班</span></span></p></td><td width="81" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 13px">12</span></p></td></tr><tr style="height:17px"><td width="141" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高中三年级</span>(08)<span style="font-family:宋体">班</span></span></p></td><td width="73" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 13px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 13px"><span style="font-family:Arial">2</span></span></p></td><td width="166" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style="vertical-align: bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 15px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高中三年级</span>(16)<span style="font-family:宋体">班</span></span></p></td><td width="81" valign="bottom" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left: none; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 13px">1</span><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 13px"><span style="font-family:Arial">3</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=";text-indent: 32px;line-height: 170%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></strong></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">Ⅰ</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、品德表现：</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以班级为单位，高中阶段总考评等第根据平时在校表现，表现突出的可认定为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等。具体学生名单由班主任老师确定。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、运动健康：</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在修完相应的课程，获得相应的学分的基础上，根据平时上课表现或在校级及以上各类体育比赛中的获奖情况，表现突出的可认定为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等。具体学生名单由体育老师确定。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">3</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、艺术素养：</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在修完相应的课程，获得相应的学分的基础上，根据平时上课表现或在校级及以上各类艺术活动中的获奖情况，表现突出的可认定为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等。具体学生名单由音、美老师确定。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">4</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、创新实践：</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在参加相关探究活动或社区、社会实践活动中表现较突出的可认定为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等。具体学生名单由本班学生、考核小组及班主任提名，德育处、团委可以事先向班级推荐优秀人员。德育处、团委根据提名进行审定。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">注：如出国或长期请假的不能评为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">等。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">Ⅱ</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各项目主要负责人</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">品德表现负责人：各班班主任；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">运动健康负责人：相关体育老师；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">艺术素养负责人：相关音乐、美术老师；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">创新实践负责人：班主任、团委。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2. </span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">请各班主任将全班学生的品德表现、创新实践、运动健康及艺术素养的考评结果以</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">Excel</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">表格的形式、班级命名上传到德育处</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">2022</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年高三学生四项等第考评</span><span style="font-family:宋体">”文件夹中。</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">EXCEL</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">表格模板见附件。</span></span></strong></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">3.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">上传考评结果截止时间</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">12</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">30</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">放学前。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">4.</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">各班考评时有下列行为的学生，当学期品德表现不能被评为</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">A</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">”：</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">1）故意损坏公物；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">2）早恋倾向；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">3）考试作弊；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">4）沉迷于电子游戏；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">5）受过学校处分尚未撤消；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">6）一学期3次以上违反住校生纪律；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">7）未经德育处审批同意私自带手机；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">8）违规使用自修教室；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">9）一学期无故不跑操3次及其以上；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">10）仪容仪表不符合《中学生日常行为规范》；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">11）一学期迟到次数5次以上（含5次）；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">12）一学期3次以上不规范穿着校服（含3次）；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">13）文明习惯、素养有明显欠缺；不文明就餐，有浪费粮食的行为</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">14）处理同学矛盾，有过激不当行为；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">（</span><span style="font-family:宋体">15）无故不参加学校集体活动，各项校级比赛（如军体运动会、校运会）；</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以上违规情况德育处和各班主任根据学生综合素质评价记录对照执行。</span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> </span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">通知二：获奖信息</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为方便相关老师评定，综合素质评价需录入学生获奖情况，按照相关要求在</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校园网上录入，具体操作见附件</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校园网获奖情况录入操作流程。截止时间</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">12</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">21</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体"> </span></span></p><p style=";line-height: 170%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">通知三：学生自我评述报告</span></span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每位学生写一篇</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">150</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">字以上、</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">500</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">字以内的自我总结，上传到浙江省普通高中学生综合素质评价管理系统。截止时间</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">1</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">12</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;color: rgb(255, 0, 0);font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。自我评述信息需登录管理平台输入。</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">管理平台的登录方法见附件。</span></span></strong></p><p style=";text-indent: 32px;line-height: 170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"> </span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:170%"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">附件：</span></span></strong></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高三学生品德表现及创新实践考评模板：</span></span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_xls.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/12/202212121541252233.xls" title="202212121541252233.xls" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202212121541252233.xls</a></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-left:0;text-indent:32px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:170%"><span style="font-family: 宋体;line-height: 170%;font-size: 16px"><span style="font-family:宋体">综合素质奖项录入操作流程：</span></span><img src="http://10.176.17.2/UEditor/dialogs/attachment/fileTypeImages/icon_doc.gif" style="vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 2px;" /><a href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/12/202212121543571535.doc" title="202212121543571535.doc" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgb(0, 102, 204);">202212121543571535.doc</a></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-right:0;margin-bottom:0;margin-